content.text:
Implement `submission/entry.py` using the complete contract in the task instruction.
The starter deliberately returns INVALID_INPUT for all requests.

Run the public sanity example:

    python3 submission/entry.py < examples/basic.json

Compare parsed JSON with `examples/basic.expected.json`. The sample is illustrative;
implement the full protocol and input-validation contract, including empty requests.
=== BASIC ===
